\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Come, Holy Ghost, our hearts inspire,
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0  Let us thine influence prove;
\par  Source of old prophetic fire,
\par  Fountain of life and love.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. Come, Holy Ghost, for moved by thee
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0 The prophets wrote and spoke;
\par Unlock the truth, thyself the key;
\par Unseal the sacred book.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.   Expand thy wings, celestial Dove,
\par \pard\li315\sl180\slmult0  Brood o'er our natures night;
\par  On our disordered spirits move,
\par  And let there now be light.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li315\sl180\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  God through himself we then shall know,
\par \pard\li315\sl180\slmult0  If thou within us shine,
\par And sound, with all thy saints below,
\par \pard        The depths of love divine.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

